              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gdawson83"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is an awesome recipe--I love it! I used a combo of natural Peanut butter and cashew butter to use up some of these that have been in my fridge for awhile and they turned out great--not as sweet as normal Peanut butter cookies, but I liked that about them. I also used some of the batter to make the little witches ' hats using dark chocolate kisses and those turned out really good, too. This is now my go-to Peanut butter cookie recipe. Thank you for sharing!",
